Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:56.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,The food is terrible. Worst shit I've ever seen, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you say? You got any biscuits over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:07:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I keep seeing corn bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:06.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I am cold.   - Still with us, Brett?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:11.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Right.   - Oh, I feel dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:14.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody ever tell you you look dead, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:21.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I just forgot something, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:23.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before we dock,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we oughta discuss the bonus situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. Brett and I, we think we oughta-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We deserve full shares, right, baby?   - You see, Mr. Parker and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:33.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,feel that the bonus situation has never been on an equitable level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:37.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll get what you're contracted for like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, but everybody else gets more than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:41.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas, Mother wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:45.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah, I saw it. Yellow light's for my eyes only.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, get dressed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:52.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker, come on. Can I finish my coffee? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:54.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing good on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:44.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Morning, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:17.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Right.   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Plug us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:29.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Earth?   - You should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:32.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not our system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:39.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.91,0:09:43.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Contact Traffic Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:47.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is commercial towing vehicle Nostromo out of the Solomons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:51.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Registration number: 1-8-0-niner-2-4-6-0-niner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:56.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Calling Antarctica Traffic Control. Can you read me? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:59.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Commercial towing vehicle Nostromo out of the Solomons,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:01.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,registration number-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Nothing.   - Keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:13.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Calling Antarctica Traffic Control. Do you read me, Antarctica? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:17.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I found it. Just short of Zeta II Reticuli.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:23.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We haven't reached the outer rim yet.   - That's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:27.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:33.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's not our system.   - I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:37.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you ever notice how they never come down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is where the work is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:42.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it's the same damn reason we get a half share to their one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:45.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our time is their time. That's the way they see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:47.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, but-Listen, man. Same old shit, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:49.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I know why they don't come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's because of you. You don't have no personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:56.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wonder what they want now.   - What's going on down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:02.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Um, you happen to be in my seat. Can I have it?   - Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you.   - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happenin' now, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:18.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, some of you may have figured out we're not home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:20.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're only halfway there.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:24.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother's interrupted the course of our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:26.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:29.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's programmed to do that should certain conditions arise. They have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:32.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Like what?   - It seems she has...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,intercepted a transmission of unknown origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:37.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She got us up to check it out.   - A transmission? Out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:40.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.   - What kind of a transmission?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:44.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Acoustical beacon. It repeats at intervals of 12 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- S.O.S.?   - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Unknown.   - Well, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:53.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are obligated under section eight-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hate to bring this up, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:58.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,this is a commercial ship, not a rescue ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:12:02.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. And it's not in my contract to do this kind of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:06.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what about the money? If you wanna give me some money, I'll be happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:08.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,The man's right. Let's go over the bonus situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:12.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry. Can I say something?   - Let's talk about the bonus more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:15.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is a clause in the contract which specifically states...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:18.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,any systematized transmission indicating a possible intelligent origin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:20.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- must be investigated.   - I don't wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:22.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We don't know if it's intelligent.   - I wanna go home and party.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:24.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker, will you just listen to the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:31.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,On penalty of total forfeiture of shares. No money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:34.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:38.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, yeah.   - All right, we're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're goin' in, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:49.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we all hear that, Lambert?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:13.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:16.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound like any radio signal I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:18.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maybe it's a voice.   - Well, we'll soon know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you hone in on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:24.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,What was the, uh, position?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:28.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,6550-99.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:36.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. It found the quadrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:40.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ascension: six minutes, 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:44.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Declination: 39 degrees, two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Put that on the screen for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:53.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:56.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a planetoid. 1200 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's tiny.   - Any rotation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:04.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,About two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:06.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about gravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:09.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Point eight-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can walk on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Approaching orbital apogee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:29.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mark 12, 11...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:32.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Equatorial orbit nailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:35.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nine, eight seconds on descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Grids energized. Fields focused.   - Five. Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- D.O.R.'s on line.   - How's the status on the lifters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:53.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me an A.C. pressure reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:02.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forty-eight seconds and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,SR-1stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:07.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prepare to disengage from platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:12.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mark, 20 seconds. Eighteen, 17-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:16.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twelve, 11, 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,nine, eight, seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:23.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,six, five, four,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:26.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,three, two, one, lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Disengage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:36.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Umbilicus clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:43.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Money's safe. Let's take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:50.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nine, eight, seven-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:53.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roll 92 degrees port yaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:55.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prime to port.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prime ventral. Prime dorsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Down a degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:26.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,39,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:37.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:47.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Locked and floating. You can drop us anytime now. We'll catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:52.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Inertial damping's going off. Hold on, people. There's gonna be a little bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:03.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pressure drop in intake three. Must've lost a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:15.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dropping off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Still dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:23.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we are. We've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:26.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Navigation lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:46.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got 5-3 still out. No problem. Just down 11%.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grid status okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fifteen,Still falling
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:07.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twelve,eleven,ten
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:09.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:13.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,eight, seven, six,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:17.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,five, four, three,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:21.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill drive engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:42.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:47.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody give me a straight answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is the hull breached?   - I don't see anything. We've still got pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:54.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hit the screen.   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Secondary load sharing unit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:07.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:10.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three to four cells are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is that it?   - No, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:19.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't fix it out here anyway, and we need to reroute...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:23.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- a couple of these ducts, wouldn't you say, Brett?   - Dry dock time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:25.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dry dock. Tell her we need to dry-dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, we couldn't fix it out here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:29.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta reroute all these ducts,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,and in order to do that we've got to dry-dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some fragments kicked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:39.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,and we've got to clean it all out and repressurize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long before we're functional?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:46.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look, what is-What   - It's 17 hours, tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:49.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least 25 hours. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:51.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get started on the floor panel. I'll be right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:53.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell's she comin' down here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:56.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,She better stay the fuck out of my way, I'll tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:58.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see what she's gonna do when she gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:12.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Any response yet?   - No. Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:15.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Except the same transmission every 12 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:17.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,All the other channels are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:26.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kick on the floods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:44.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't go anywhere in this. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Mother says the sun's coming up in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:50.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How far are we from the source of transmission?   - Uh, northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just under 2,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:55.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Walking distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:01.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can you give me an atmospheric?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's almost primordial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's inert nitrogen,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:14.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,high concentration of carbon dioxide crystals, methane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:16.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm working on the trace elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:18.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Anything else?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,rock, lava base,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:25.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,and deep cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:29.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well below the line. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:32.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll volunteer to be in the first group to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:34.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You too, Lambert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:41.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Swell.   - Better break out the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:58.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't see a goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash, are you receiving?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.71,0:23:09.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good contact on my board.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.09,0:23:13.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Clear and free. Keep the line open. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.69,0:23:30.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:32.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ripley, I wanna ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:37.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,If they find what they're lookin' for out there, does that mean we get full shares?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.95,0:23:42.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Parker. You'll get whatever's coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:44.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not gonna do any more work...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:47.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- till we get this straightened out.   - Brett,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:51.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- you're guaranteed by law to get a share.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.63,0:23:54.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why don't you just fuck off.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.89,0:23:57.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,What'd you say, Rip?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:24:01.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you have any trouble, I'll be on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:05.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ripley, come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.15,0:24:13.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Son of a bitch.   - What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.17,0:24:25.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't see a goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:28.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Quit griping.   - I like griping.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.80,0:24:30.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:25:56.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash, can you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.93,0:25:59.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.26,0:26:04.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:15.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:20.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.67,0:26:32.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.13,0:26:34.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moving on to second... position.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.71,0:26:37.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.43,0:26:41.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.22,0:26:43.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got this far. We must go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.97,0:26:45.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.19,0:26:52.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Will you say that again?   -  Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:26:58.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash, as you can see, it's kind of hard to describe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.20,0:27:00.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to the console.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.80,0:27:18.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seems to be solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:20.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,To walk-You can on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.66,0:27:50.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.30,0:28:44.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on down here. Something different down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:48.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is, but-
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.47,0:28:51.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,See if we can get up that wall. If we can get up that wall, we can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:29:59.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.96,0:30:02.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alien life-form.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:07.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's been dead a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.18,0:30:10.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fossilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.18,0:30:13.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's grown out of the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.65,0:30:25.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bones are bent outward,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.86,0:30:28.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,like he exploded from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:33.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wonder what happened to the rest of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.54,0:30:41.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:55.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dallas, Lambert, come on over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.02,0:31:01.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.03,0:31:08.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do you got?   - See what you make of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:17.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.58,0:31:21.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,That transmission-Mother's deciphered part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.08,0:31:23.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It doesn't look like an S.O.S.   - What is it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.63,0:31:26.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I-It looks like a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.05,0:31:29.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna go out after them.   - What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:35.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, by the time it takes to get there, you'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.81,0:31:38.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,they'll know if it's a warning or not, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.34,0:32:07.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You okay down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.68,0:32:14.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can you see anything?   - Uh... a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,A ca-A cave of some sort. But l-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.06,0:32:23.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know, but it's like the goddamn tropics in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.19,0:32:29.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.89,0:32:59.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,The cave is completely enclosed,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.93,0:33:02.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,and it's full of...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.39,0:33:06.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,leathery objects, like eggs or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.04,0:33:26.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a layer of mist...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.58,0:33:30.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,just covering the eggs that reacts when broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kane? You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.84,0:33:39.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:43.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. I just slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:06.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Appears to be completely sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.83,0:34:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. There's movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.91,0:34:49.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems to have life. Organic life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.11,0:35:56.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You there, Ripley?   - I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.20,0:36:06.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, Ripley, I'm at the inner lock hatch now.   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.96,0:36:18.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ripley. We're clean. Let us in.   - Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:21.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened to Kane?   - Something has attached itself to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.63,0:36:24.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We have to get him to the infirmary right away.   - What kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:27.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I need a clear definition.   - An organism. Open the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:30.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. If we let it in, the ship could be infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.14,0:36:33.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know the quarantine procedure-24 hours for decontamination.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:35.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,He could die in 24 hours. Open the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.98,0:36:38.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. If we break quarantine, we could all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.90,0:36:43.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, would you open the goddamn hatch? We have to get him inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.66,0:36:46.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.91,0:36:49.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if you were in my position, you'd do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.41,0:36:51.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, this is an order. Open that hatch right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.41,0:36:53.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you hear me?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.37,0:36:55.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, this is an order! Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:59.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I read you. The answer is negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:03.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Inner hatch opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:45.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.55,0:37:49.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.89,0:37:54.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.98,0:37:58.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, how the hell is he breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.40,0:38:00.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is he still alive or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:03.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys freeze him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.44,0:38:05.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,How come they don't freeze him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.57,0:38:09.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What the fuck is going on?   - You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.99,0:38:12.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.54,0:38:14.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You would've left us out there.   - Break it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.87,0:38:19.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, when I give an order, I expect to be obeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:22.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Even if it's against the law?   - You're goddamn right!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:25.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe she has a point. Who the hell knows what that thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.92,0:38:28.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna get that off him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.84,0:38:32.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How are we gonna get it off?   - I'm gonna get some instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.31,0:38:38.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.73,0:38:44.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll make an incision here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.61,0:38:50.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try and remove one of the digitals from-You're gonna do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.12,0:38:54.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Finger. I'm gonna try and get his finger off. Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.50,0:39:02.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, that's not-It's tearing his scalp.   - I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.21,0:39:06.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not coming off without tearing his face off with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.59,0:39:08.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll have to take a look at him inside. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.97,0:39:14.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,How come they don't freeze him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.81,0:39:17.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,How come you guys don't freeze him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.37,0:39:35.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, you can take your mask off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.35,0:40:00.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's it got down his throat?   - I would suggest it's feeding him oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.35,0:40:04.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Paralyzes him, puts him in a coma, then keeps him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.94,0:40:07.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now what the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.90,0:40:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We gotta get it off of him.   - Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:11.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.91,0:40:14.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, let's not be too hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.45,0:40:16.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't know anything about...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.70,0:40:18.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.75,0:40:21.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, we're assuming it's feeding him oxygen. If we remove it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.21,0:40:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,it could kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.80,0:40:29.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to take that chance. Let's cut it off him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.09,0:40:33.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You'll take responsibility?   - Yes, I'll take responsibility. Get him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.55,0:40:37.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where do you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:40.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll make an incision just below the knuckle there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.06,0:40:42.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right here. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.49,0:40:53.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.91,0:41:00.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,That crap's gonna eat through the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.12,0:41:04.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,That thing's gonna eat through the goddamn hull. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.50,0:41:07.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.13,0:41:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.26,0:41:19.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.66,0:41:38.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.49,0:41:42.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't get under it! Don't get under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.29,0:41:50.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.17,0:41:55.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this, man. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.17,0:41:58.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brett, give me-What do you got, a pen there? Give it to me, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.80,0:42:00.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.35,0:42:07.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't get any on your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:17.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,It stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.41,0:42:21.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't see anything like that except, uh, molecular acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.53,0:42:24.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,It must be using it for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.70,0:42:26.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's got a wonderful defense mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.71,0:42:28.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't dare kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.00,0:42:30.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.84,0:42:36.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Here's your pen back.   - What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.38,0:42:39.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave Kane to Ash. You get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.72,0:42:43.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what-
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.02,0:42:54.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.98,0:42:57.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.91,0:43:03.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it. I thought sure that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.04,0:43:07.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.37,0:43:10.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've been in this place a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.46,0:43:14.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have landed in this place in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.71,0:43:19.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't have landed on this damn ball, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.05,0:43:25.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, the sooner we patch this thing up and get out of here, the sooner we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.19,0:43:27.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,This place gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.91,0:44:32.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's amazing. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.00,0:44:37.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, it is. Um-
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.30,0:44:39.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.22,0:44:45.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:47.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. I, uh-
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.27,0:44:52.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have a little talk. How's, uh-How's Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.27,0:44:54.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's holding. No changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.94,0:44:59.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,And, uh, our guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.70,0:45:04.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, as I said, I'm still...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.66,0:45:06.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,collating, actually, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.70,0:45:10.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have confirmed that he's got an outer layer of protein polysaccharides.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.50,0:45:14.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,He has a funny habit of shedding his cells...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.87,0:45:18.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,and replacing them with... polarized silicon,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.79,0:45:20.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,which gives him a prolonged resistance...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.01,0:45:24.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,to adverse environmental conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.05,0:45:27.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is that enough for you?   - That's plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.18,0:45:30.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What does it mean?   - Please don't do that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.52,0:45:33.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.64,0:45:35.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it's an interesting combination of elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.65,0:45:40.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,making him a tough little son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.27,0:45:42.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.74,0:45:45.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was obeying a direct order, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:49.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash, when Dallas and Kane are off the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.37,0:45:51.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm senior officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.54,0:45:54.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.50,0:45:57.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You also forgot the science division's basic quarantine law.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:46:00.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, that I didn't forget.   - Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.29,0:46:02.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just broke it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.05,0:46:06.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, what would you have done with Kane? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.76,0:46:10.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,You knew his only chance of survival was to get him in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.14,0:46:12.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, by breaking quarantine,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.64,0:46:14.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,you risk everybody's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.68,0:46:17.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should've left him outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.85,0:46:21.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I've jeopardized the rest of us, but it was a risk I was willing to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.77,0:46:23.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty big risk...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.03,0:46:25.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,for a science officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.03,0:46:29.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's, uh, not exactly out of the manual, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.83,0:46:34.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I do take my responsibilities as seriously as you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.41,0:46:37.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You do your job...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.42,0:46:39.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,and let me do mine, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:02.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Dallas?   - In the shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.95,0:47:10.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Dallas.   - I think you should have a look at Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.62,0:47:14.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why?   - Something's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.74,0:47:17.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Serious?   - lnteresting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.29,0:47:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, meet me in the infirmary right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.38,0:47:30.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.43,0:47:33.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know. I mean, we ought to try and find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.35,0:47:35.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.92,0:48:04.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas, please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.25,0:48:47.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.45,0:49:23.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, not in the corner. Psst. Have one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.25,0:49:27.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:43.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kane? Dallas?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.23,0:49:50.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You okay?   - I didn't see it. Was it in the overhead?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.52,0:49:54.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? It was up there somewhere. - My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.40,0:49:57.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cover up the damn thing!   - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:50:00.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.20,0:50:02.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a reflex action.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.12,0:50:06.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we've gotta have a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.93,0:50:20.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.73,0:50:29.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Seems dead enough.   - Well, good. Let's get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.02,0:50:33.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, for God's sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.61,0:50:37.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,this is the first time that we've encountered a species like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.11,0:50:39.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,It has to go back. All sorts of tests have to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.74,0:50:42.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash, are you kidding? This thing bled acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.28,0:50:45.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who knows what it's gonna do when it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.12,0:50:48.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think it's safe to assume it isn't a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.42,0:50:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas, it has to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.17,0:50:53.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.75,0:50:56.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,as not burn it at the stake, but you're the science officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.34,0:50:57.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's your decision, Ash.   - Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.09,0:51:01.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,How come I've got to change my mind? The decision's been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.47,0:51:03.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to change your mind, Dallas. I just want you to listen-
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.97,0:51:05.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you listen to-
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.27,0:51:10.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just tell me how you can leave that kind of decision to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:12.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I just run the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.69,0:51:15.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything that has to do with the science division, Ash has the final word.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.28,0:51:18.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How does that happen?   - It happens, my dear, because that's what the company wants to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.65,0:51:21.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Since when is that standard procedure?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.45,0:51:24.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Standard procedure is to do what the hell they tell you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.16,0:51:27.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's happening with the repairs? How's it going?   - They're pretty much finished now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.00,0:51:29.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why the hell didn't you tell me so?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.00,0:51:32.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Because there's still some things left to do.   - Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.67,0:51:35.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we're blind on "B" and "C" decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.17,0:51:38.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The reserve power system's blown   - That's a bunch of horseshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.13,0:51:41.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We can take off without that.   - Yeah, we can. You think that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.34,0:51:44.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I just wanna get the hell out of here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.41,0:52:11.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dust in the intakes again. Number two's overheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:13.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spit on it for two minutes, would you, for Christ's sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.92,0:52:17.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're hot. We're getting hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.01,0:52:23.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Engine room, red clip status?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.76,0:52:27.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One kilometer on ascension.   - Engage artificial gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:31.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Engaged.   - I'm altering the vector now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.73,0:52:37.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Inhibit C.N.G. control.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.82,0:52:45.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Struts retract.   - Struts retracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.74,0:52:49.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Max stress to fifth overload.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.95,0:52:52.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ease it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.54,0:52:55.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's great. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.05,0:53:10.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Walk in the park. When we fix something, we stay fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.27,0:53:13.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't we, Brett baby?   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.41,0:53:30.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I think we should do is just freeze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:32.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,If he's got a disease, why don't we stop it where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.79,0:53:36.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He can always get to a doctor when we get back home.   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.50,0:53:40.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whenever he says anything, you say "right," Brett. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.30,0:53:42.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.55,0:53:45.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker, what do you think? Your staffjust follows you around, says "right."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.51,0:53:47.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just like a regular parrot.   - Yeah. Shape up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.01,0:53:51.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you, some kind of parrot?   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.10,0:53:54.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Knock it off! Kane's gonna have to go into quarantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.18,0:53:56.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it. Yes, and so will we.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.06,0:53:59.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, how about a little something to lower your spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.40,0:54:01.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thrill me, will you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.57,0:54:03.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, according to my calculations,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.57,0:54:05.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,based on time spent getting to and from the planet-
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.61,0:54:08.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just give me the short version. How far to Earth?   - Ten months.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.95,0:54:10.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, God.   - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.99,0:54:12.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.87,0:54:14.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas, I think you should come and see Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.00,0:54:18.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Has his condition changed?   - It's simpler if you'd just come and see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.42,0:54:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.92,0:54:24.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.97,0:54:29.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.92,0:54:34.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How you doin'?   - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:36.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Um, terrific. Next silly question.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.47,0:54:42.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.56,0:54:47.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you remember anything about the planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.11,0:54:52.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the last thing you do remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.45,0:55:01.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I remember some...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.45,0:55:04.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,horrible dream about... smothering.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.20,0:55:06.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,And-
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.08,0:55:08.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,And-Anyway, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.71,0:55:11.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Right here.   - We're on our way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.13,0:55:13.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back to the old freezerinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.38,0:55:17.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could I have something to eat before we go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.63,0:55:19.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I-I need something myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.55,0:55:23.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. One more meal before bedtime. I'm buyin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.31,0:55:26.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a break. Bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.12,0:55:48.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,The first thing that I'm gonna do when I get back...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.75,0:55:50.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,is to get some decent food.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.83,0:55:53.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can dig it, man. Let me tell you, I've eaten worse food than this,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.67,0:55:56.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,but then I've tasted better, you know what I'm sayin'? The other one over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.42,0:55:59.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you pound down the stuff like there's no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.59,0:56:02.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be eatin' something else, but, uh, right now I'm thinkin' food.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.97,0:56:06.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you should know. You know what it's made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:10.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, man, I don't wanna talk about what it's made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.15,0:56:12.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm eatin' this just to-
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.48,0:56:15.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.48,0:56:17.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,The food ain't that bad, baby. What's wrong, Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.82,0:56:19.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you choking?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.82,0:56:21.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.49,0:56:25.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:28.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is serious.   - Kane, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.91,0:56:32.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.96,0:56:36.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold him down! Hold him-
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.67,0:56:38.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the spoon in!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.88,0:56:42.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.59,0:56:44.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get it into his mouth!   - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.71,0:57:16.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.72,0:57:26.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Don't touch it! Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.36,0:57:45.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.62,0:57:48.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Dallas?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.29,0:57:52.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Anything?   - No. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.21,0:57:54.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.67,0:57:57.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You see anything?   - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.61,0:58:20.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Inner hatch sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.45,0:58:26.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody wanna say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.98,0:59:06.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is just an ordinary prod, like a cattle prod.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.53,0:59:08.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's got a portable battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.53,0:59:11.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's insulated all the way here, all the way up to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.33,0:59:14.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just make damn sure nobody puts their hand on the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.83,0:59:19.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't damage the little bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.83,0:59:22.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,unless its skin's thinner than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.42,0:59:26.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it will give him a little incentive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.68,0:59:28.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.76,0:59:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've taken care of that. I've designed this tracking device.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.68,0:59:37.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just set it to search for a moving object, like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.19,0:59:39.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hasn't got much of a range, but when you get within a certain distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.77,0:59:41.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,it'll start to give off a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.90,0:59:44.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's it key on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.07,0:59:48.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Micro changes in air density.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.91,0:59:51.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me a demo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.95,0:59:56.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.71,0:59:59.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.12,1:00:02.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two teams. Ash, Lambert and l.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.71,1:00:06.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ripley, you take Parker and Brett.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.21,1:00:08.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, anyone see this thing, you catch it in the net...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.80,1:00:10.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,that Parker's holding on his lap.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.01,1:00:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker, I don't want any heroics out of you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.01,1:00:17.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Catch it, put it in the air lock, get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.52,1:00:19.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, channels are open on all decks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.48,1:00:23.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you to communicate, keep in touch at all times, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.69,1:00:25.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.24,1:00:31.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you fixed 12 module.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.99,1:00:34.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,We did.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.24,1:00:36.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.41,1:00:40.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,The circuits must have burned out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.51,1:00:56.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do we got here?   - Damn it! Hold your light over here, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.43,1:00:58.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.43,1:01:02.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.48,1:01:05.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I could just put this-put this in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.19,1:01:07.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Right.   - Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.15,1:01:13.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check the insulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.70,1:01:15.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.97,1:01:41.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Steady.   - According to this, it's within five meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:49.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Micro changes in air density, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.86,1:01:57.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's within five meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.41,1:01:59.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.84,1:02:11.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Christ.   - Don't do that. Don't creep up on me with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.44,1:02:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys, stick together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.11,1:02:33.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't fail me now.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.95,1:02:36.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it? Parker, Brett, it's in this locker!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.20,1:02:38.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.20,1:02:40.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.29,1:02:42.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get over there and get the net.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.83,1:02:45.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get it? I got it. I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.50,1:02:48.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.34,1:02:52.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, Parker. When I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.88,1:02:56.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.55,1:02:58.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.22,1:03:04.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't let him go!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.93,1:03:07.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.23,1:03:09.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.61,1:03:18.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, now. We had to bag it, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.57,1:03:21.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now we might pick it up on the tracker again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.91,1:03:24.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll-I'll-I'll-Go and get it, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.16,1:03:27.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. You get him. We'll go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.59,1:03:41.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.10,1:03:43.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty, kitty!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.56,1:03:45.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough of that kitty crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.07,1:03:49.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:51.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jonesy?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.03,1:03:54.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.79,1:04:03.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jonesy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.88,1:04:11.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.73,1:04:20.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.91,1:04:33.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jonesy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.05,1:04:47.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.43,1:06:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kitty, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:21.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.18,1:06:23.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.44,1:06:27.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.10,1:07:03.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kitty, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.02,1:07:09.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jonesy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.03,1:07:18.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey. Come on, Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.95,1:07:21.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby. That's a kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.33,1:07:24.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a kitty. Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.79,1:07:27.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.67,1:07:31.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.63,1:07:33.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.08,1:08:04.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brett!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.08,1:08:07.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brett!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.67,1:08:17.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brett!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.97,1:08:28.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was, it was-it was big and-
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.27,1:08:34.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're sure it took him into the air shaft?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.65,1:08:36.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Disappeared into one of the cooling ducts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.90,1:08:40.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,No question, it's-it's using the air ducts to move around.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.37,1:08:45.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could he want Brett alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.87,1:08:49.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   - Could Brett be alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.62,1:08:52.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I mean, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.38,1:08:56.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, this air shaft may work to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.38,1:09:01.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here it leads up to and comes out in the main air lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.26,1:09:03.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. There's only one big opening along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.64,1:09:06.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can cover that up, and then we...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.06,1:09:09.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,drive it into the air lock and zap it into outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:12.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,This son of a bitch is huge!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.10,1:09:15.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I mean, it's like a man. It's big!   - Kane's son.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.90,1:09:20.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ash. Science department should be able to help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.45,1:09:22.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,What can we do to drive it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.91,1:09:25.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, it's adapted remarkably well to our atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.28,1:09:27.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,considering its nutritional requirements.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.49,1:09:30.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The only thing we don't know about is temperature.   - Okay. What about temperature?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.12,1:09:32.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happens if we change it?   - Let's try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.92,1:09:36.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, most animals retreat from fire. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.29,1:09:38.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire, yeah. Parker, can you rig...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.84,1:09:41.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,three or four incinerator units?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:44.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me about 20 minutes. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.19,1:09:46.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who gets to go into the vent?   - I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.07,1:09:52.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. You and Ash...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.31,1:09:54.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,take the main air lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.56,1:09:58.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker, Lambert, you cover up that maintenance opening, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.44,1:10:00.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.10,1:10:33.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm at the first junction.   - Dallas, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.73,1:10:37.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Parker?   - Yeah?   - Lambert?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.61,1:10:39.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're in position. I'm just trying to get a reading here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.98,1:10:42.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The air lock is open.   - Okay, Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.82,1:10:45.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.83,1:10:57.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. I've got a reading on you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.68,1:11:16.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, open the hatch to the third junction.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.45,1:11:35.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.46,1:11:37.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ripley?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.46,1:11:40.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Close all the hatches behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.33,1:11:42.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm moving on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.23,1:11:59.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas, hold it a minute. I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.56,1:12:04.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I've got it.   - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.28,1:12:08.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's somewhere around the third junction.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.11,1:12:10.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, moving on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.47,1:12:33.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is right around there. Now, Dallas, you're gonna have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.23,1:12:48.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. I've reached...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.44,1:12:52.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,the third junction, and I'm going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.38,1:13:12.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,The hell's the matter with that box?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.80,1:13:16.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas, you're gonna have to hold your position for a minute. I-
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.68,1:13:18.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've lost the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.81,1:13:21.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.81,1:13:25.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look around. Are you sure it's not there? It's got to be around there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.07,1:13:33.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Checked it out, Lambert. You may be getting interserence.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.03,1:13:35.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas, are you sure there's no sign of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.95,1:13:40.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, it is there. It's gotta be around there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.37,1:13:47.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Dallas?   - God, what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.55,1:13:50.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.34,1:13:58.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, am I-am I clear, Lambert? I want to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.02,1:14:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. It's moving right towards you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.78,1:14:16.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move! Get out of there! Behind you! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.20,1:14:19.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas! Move, Dallas! Move, Dallas!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.37,1:14:23.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.12,1:14:24.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,The other way!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.71,1:14:28.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.59,1:14:30.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no.   - Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.42,1:14:32.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.05,1:14:40.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,We found this laying there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.89,1:14:44.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,No blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.23,1:14:47.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,No Dallas. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.90,1:14:56.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How come I don't hear nobody saying nothing?   - I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.45,1:15:03.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless somebody has got a better idea,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.38,1:15:06.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,we'll proceed with Dallas's plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.92,1:15:10.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? And end up like the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.25,1:15:12.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ohh. No, you're out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.76,1:15:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Got a better idea?   - Yes. I say that we abandon this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.09,1:15:19.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We get the shuttle and just get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.43,1:15:22.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,We take our chances and just hope that...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.47,1:15:24.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- somebody picks us up.   - Lambert.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.48,1:15:28.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The shuttle won't take four.   - Then why don't we draw straws and-
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.27,1:15:31.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not drawin' any straws. I'm for killing that goddamn thing right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.44,1:15:33.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.61,1:15:35.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, let's talk about killing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.69,1:15:38.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,We know it's using the air shafts-Will you listen to me, Parker?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.95,1:15:41.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Shut up!   - Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.83,1:15:43.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.83,1:15:47.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's using the air shafts.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.16,1:15:49.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We don't know that.   - That's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.00,1:15:53.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll move in pairs. We'll go step by step...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:56.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,and cut off every bulkhead and every vent...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.17,1:15:59.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,until we have it cornered, and then we'll blow it the fuck out into space.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.51,1:16:01.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that acceptable to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.80,1:16:06.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- If it means killing it, it's acceptable to me.   - Obviously it means killing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.98,1:16:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.15,1:16:13.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How are our weapons?   - The weapons are fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.69,1:16:17.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This one needs refueling.   - Will you get it, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.70,1:16:21.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ash, go with him.   - No, no. I can manage, Ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.78,1:16:23.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.33,1:16:29.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.62,1:16:33.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any suggestions from you or Mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.05,1:16:38.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, we're still collating.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.01,1:16:41.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're what?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.34,1:16:43.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're still collating?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.64,1:16:46.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.73,1:16:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What would you like me to do?   - Just what you've been doing, Ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.98,1:16:54.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I've got access to Mother now,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.02,1:16:57.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'll get my own answers, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.61,1:17:03.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.05,1:18:44.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is an explanation for this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.43,1:18:48.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there really? I don't wanna hear your goddamn explanation!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.56,1:18:53.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want-I want-
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:59.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want-I w-
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.78,1:19:08.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker. Lambert?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.12,1:19:20.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.18,1:19:32.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash-
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.10,1:19:38.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you open the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.44,1:19:42.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me by, Ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.98,1:21:07.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.34,1:21:29.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get her up. Get her up. Get her up. Get her up. Get her up. Get her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.48,1:21:42.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Android! He's an android!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.62,1:21:59.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.83,1:22:06.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a robot. Ash is a goddamn robot!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.05,1:22:10.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.72,1:22:16.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Get off me-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.47,1:22:18.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.51,1:22:22.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Help me get this fucking thing off!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.65,1:22:32.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,God! Jesus! Oh, God! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.62,1:22:40.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,How come the company sent us a goddamn robot?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.66,1:22:44.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,All I can think of is they must've wanted the alien for their weapons division.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.50,1:22:47.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's been protecting it right along.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.38,1:22:49.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker, will you plug it in?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.75,1:22:54.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know why   - Because he may know how to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.87,1:23:22.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.54,1:23:27.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.59,1:23:37.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.81,1:23:47.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was your special order?   - You read it. I thought it was clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.44,1:23:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was it?   - Bring back life-form.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.52,1:23:56.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Priority one. All other priorities rescinded.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.20,1:24:03.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,The damn company! What about our lives, you son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.99,1:24:07.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I repeat: All other priorities are rescinded.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.04,1:24:10.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do we kill it, Ash?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.50,1:24:13.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a way of killing it. How-How do we do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.88,1:24:22.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's bullshit! - You still don't understand what you're dealing with, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.85,1:24:26.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,A persect organism.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.14,1:24:32.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Its structural persection is matched only by its hostility.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.86,1:24:35.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You admire it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.15,1:24:41.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I admire its purity.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.58,1:24:47.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,A survivor...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.58,1:24:53.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,unclouded by conscience,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.92,1:24:57.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,remorse or delusions of morality.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.55,1:25:02.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I-I've heard enough of this,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.30,1:25:04.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'm asking you to pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.81,1:25:08.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Last word.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.98,1:25:14.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't lie to you about your chances, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.19,1:25:19.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,you have my sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.11,1:25:25.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna blow up the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.24,1:25:27.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll take our chances in the shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.12,1:25:30.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Blow up the ship.   - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.54,1:25:32.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.07,1:26:02.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- When we throw the switches, how long before the ship blows?   - Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.32,1:26:05.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No bullshit.   - If we ain't outta here in ten minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.13,1:26:08.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,we won't need no rocket to fly through space.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.33,1:26:11.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need coolant for the air support system.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.09,1:26:19.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You two go down, get all the coolant you can carry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.84,1:26:23.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get the shuttle ready. I'll give you about...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.25,1:26:25.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,about seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.43,1:26:27.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back up here. I'll shut the switches off,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.09,1:26:29.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,and we'll blow this fucker off into space.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.05,1:26:32.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.09,1:26:34.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ready?   - Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.10,1:26:36.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.29,1:26:59.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.87,1:27:06.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.78,1:27:54.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.48,1:28:26.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, check the bottles.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.18,1:28:42.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.68,1:28:48.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How you doin'?   - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.60,1:28:51.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.31,1:28:53.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.44,1:28:57.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.78,1:29:04.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Psst! Psst! Psst! Psst! Kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.62,1:29:06.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here, Jones. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.08,1:29:09.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.54,1:29:15.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.54,1:29:17.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.42,1:29:19.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.92,1:29:21.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.97,1:29:24.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.72,1:29:31.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here. Come here, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.77,1:29:34.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.78,1:29:45.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones? Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.41,1:29:49.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.33,1:29:57.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jones! Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.17,1:30:03.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.51,1:30:11.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, sweetie. Nice kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.20,1:30:36.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.21,1:30:39.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get out of the way.   - I can't get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.71,1:30:42.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, Lambert! It's gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.63,1:30:45.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.51,1:30:48.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lambert, for Christ's sake, get out of the way!   - Parker? Lambert-
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.90,1:31:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, Lambert!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.48,1:31:03.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker? Lambert?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.49,1:31:07.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lambert? Parker?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.02,1:31:39.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get outta the room!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.71,1:32:00.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.35,1:32:19.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.49,1:33:56.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Danger. The emergency destruct system...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.08,1:33:59.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,is now activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.49,1:34:02.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ship will detonate in T-minus...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.75,1:34:05.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.00,1:34:09.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,The option to override automatic detonation...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.25,1:34:13.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,expires in T-minus five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.33,1:34:47.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,The option to override automatic detonation...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.38,1:34:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,expires in T-minus-
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.04,1:35:28.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.05,1:35:35.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brett.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.89,1:35:46.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh.   - Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.90,1:35:52.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.09,1:37:04.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,The option to override automatic detonation...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.05,1:37:08.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,expires in T-minus...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.14,1:37:10.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.43,1:37:49.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,The option to override...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.02,1:37:53.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,automatic detonation expires...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.10,1:37:55.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,in T-minus one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.36,1:38:07.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty-nine, 28, 27,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.91,1:38:12.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,26, 25, 24,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.66,1:38:15.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,23, 22,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.37,1:38:18.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,21, 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.50,1:38:20.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nineteen, 18,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.55,1:38:23.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,17, 16,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.76,1:38:27.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,15, 14, 13,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.51,1:38:31.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,12, 11, 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.89,1:38:36.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nine, eight, seven,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.10,1:38:39.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,six, five, four,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.90,1:38:44.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.45,1:38:47.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,The option to override detonation procedure...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.03,1:38:49.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,has now expired.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.49,1:38:55.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother? I've turned the cooling unit back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.83,1:38:58.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.17,1:39:01.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ship will automatically destruct...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.42,1:39:05.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,in T-minus five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.51,1:39:10.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.78,1:39:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.82,1:39:28.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.22,1:40:32.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.97,1:41:20.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,You now have one minute to abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.94,1:41:24.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ship will automatically destruct...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.56,1:41:27.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,in T-minus one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.00,1:41:51.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,T-minus 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.76,1:41:54.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty-nine, 28,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.76,1:41:56.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,27, 26,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.93,1:41:59.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,25, 24,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.02,1:42:04.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,23, 22, 21,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.35,1:42:06.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.61,1:42:08.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nineteen, 18,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.98,1:42:11.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,17, 16,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.36,1:42:14.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,15, 14, 13,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.32,1:42:17.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,12, 11, 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.95,1:42:21.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nine, eight, seven,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.29,1:42:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,six, five,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.17,1:42:28.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.59,1:43:18.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got you,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.76,1:43:23.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.14,1:44:07.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh, shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.18,1:44:09.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.44,1:44:20.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.12,1:44:25.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh, shh. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.67,1:44:36.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. It's nice to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.84,1:44:38.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.84,1:44:40.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.41,1:49:13.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.28,1:49:15.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.95,1:49:19.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,My lucky star.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.87,1:49:23.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You... are my.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.33,1:49:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucky star.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.54,1:49:27.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.67,1:49:31.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucky, lucky, lucky, lucky, lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.97,1:49:34.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.81,1:49:43.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.56,1:49:45.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.31,1:49:50.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,My lucky star.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.11,1:49:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.53,1:49:57.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are my lucky star.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.54,1:50:02.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are my lucky star.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.71,1:50:06.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are my lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.13,1:50:09.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.90,1:50:30.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,My-My lucky-
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.57,1:50:33.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You... are my.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.20,1:50:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are my.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.62,1:50:47.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.15,1:51:57.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Final report of the commercial starship Nostromo.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.32,1:52:00.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Third officer reporting.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.24,1:52:03.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,The other members of the crew-
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.58,1:52:05.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kane, Lambert,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.75,1:52:08.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Parker, Brett,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.67,1:52:12.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ash and Captain Dallas-are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.96,1:52:16.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cargo and ship destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.88,1:52:20.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I should reach the frontier in about six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.68,1:52:24.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,With a little luck, the network will pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.51,1:52:29.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Ripley, last survivor of the Nostromo,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.15,1:52:32.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,signing off.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.83,1:52:40.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:57.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,《异形》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,(宇宙货船 诺斯托罗莫号)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,(船员: 七名)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:16.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,(货物: 二千万吨矿石)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:18.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,(航道: 回航地球)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:56.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里的伙食简直是给猪吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说呢?有饼干吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:07:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,有玉米面包
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:06.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好冷呀!  - 你没事吧,布瑞?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:11.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没事  - 觉得好像死了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:14.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人说你看起来像死人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:21.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我忘了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:23.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,回去之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该谈谈分红的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们应该得到全部  - 我和派克...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,都觉得很不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:37.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和别人一样都是按合约拿钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家拿的比我们多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:41.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,电脑老妈找你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:45.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,亮黄灯就是叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克,穿衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:52.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,先让我喝完咖啡,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:54.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,船上只有咖啡好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:44.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,早上好,老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,(界面2037请输入查询)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:10.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,(怎么回事,老妈)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:17.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可以吗?  - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,启动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:29.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 地球呢?  - 你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:32.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是太阳系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:39.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.91,0:09:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,联络航管中心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:47.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是诺斯托罗莫号货船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:51.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,编号180924609
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:56.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,呼叫南极航管中心,听到吗?完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:59.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是诺斯托罗莫号货船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:01.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,编号
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没反应  - 继续试
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:13.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,呼叫南极航管中心,听到吗?中心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:17.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到了,靠近特奇拉星球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:23.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们还没接近外围  - 好像不太妙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来这儿干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,你在说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:33.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这不是太阳系  - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:37.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道他们为何都不下来?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们以为工作不多?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:42.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我们才分一半红
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:45.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们花的时间不值钱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:47.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,但是,听着,真老套
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道他们为何不下来?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你很讨人厌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:56.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想知道他们现在需要什么  - 下面发生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:02.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是我的座位  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:18.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也发现我们还没到家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:20.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们才在半途  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:24.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,电脑老妈改变了行程
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:26.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:29.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,在某些状况下电脑可以做些改变
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:32.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 比如什么情况?  - 似乎...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,电脑收到来历不明的信号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:37.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 航道改变好让我们去查看  - 信号?在这儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:40.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错  - 什么样的信号?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:44.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,每隔十二秒一次的重复信号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 求救信号?  - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,人类吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不明  - 又怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:53.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要遵守规定...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,别怪我多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:58.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过这是货船不是救生船
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:12:02.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,合约上没要我干这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,有钱拿吗?如果有好处,我还可以考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:08.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说得对,咱们谈谈分红的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:12.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能插个嘴吗?  - 再谈谈分红的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:15.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,合约规定,收到有系统的通讯...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:18.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能来自有智慧生物...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:20.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们就得去调查  - 我不想听
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:22.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道是否智慧  - 我只想赶快回家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:24.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克,听他说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:31.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,违约的话,酬劳全都泡汤,不付钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:34.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 明白  - 那就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,那就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:49.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,放出来让大家听,兰波特
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:13.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:16.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不像一般无线电讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:18.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 像在讲话  - 马上就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,向对方发讯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:24.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我方位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:28.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,6550-99
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:36.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,找到象限了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:40.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,上升度: 6分20秒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:44.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,倾度: 39度零2秒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,播放在荧幕上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:53.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:56.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,是个小行星,直径1200公里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好小  - 转速呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:04.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,两小时自转一次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:06.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,地心引力呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:09.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,0.86重力加速度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以在上面走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:26.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,快到轨道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:29.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,倒计时,12、11...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:32.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,进降落轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:35.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,9、8秒后降落
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 网格划分完毕,已确认地点  - 5、4...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 垂直降落线定好  - 推进器的状况如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:53.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我压力指数
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:02.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,四十八秒,继续计时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,SR-1稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:07.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备脱离平台
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:12.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,还剩20秒...18、17秒...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:16.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,12、11、10秒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,9、8、7秒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:23.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,6、5、4秒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:26.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,3、2、1秒,锁定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,脱离
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.85,0:15:36.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全了,下降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:50.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,9、8、7秒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:53.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,向左倾斜92度
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:55.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,向左
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,向前,向后
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,下降一度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:26.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,39,000米
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:37.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,乱流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,锁住,漂浮中,随时准备降落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:52.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,一开始会有点晃动,大家坐稳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:03.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,压力下降,大概防护板掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续进行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:15.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,下降了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,持续下降
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:23.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:26.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,降落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开导航灯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:46.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们离地面还有3个5米,没问题,刚下降了11%
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,网格状态...OK
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,15米,还在下降
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:07.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,12、11、10米...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:09.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,9米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:13.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,8、7、6米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:17.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,5、4、3米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,2、1米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:21.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,关掉引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:42.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:47.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,快回答呀!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 船体破了吗?  - 看不到,压力还是很大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:54.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 打开荧幕  - 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,辅助支援系统...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:07.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,故障
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:10.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,四根架子坏掉三根
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就这样?  - 不,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:19.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,没办法在这儿修好,线路得...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:23.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 重新接好,你是内行,布瑞特  - 修复管线
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫他修复管线
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,没办法在这儿修好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:29.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,线路得全部重整
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须先修复主要管线
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,出现一些碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:39.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须清除和减压
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要多少时间?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:46.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这样...  - 就说要17小时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,最少需要25小时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:51.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,我马上下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:53.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,她下来干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:56.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,她最好别惹我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:58.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我倒要看看她有什么本事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:12.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有反应吗?  - 完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:15.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是每12秒重复一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:17.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他频道都故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:26.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开灯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:44.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么暗哪儿都不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,电脑说二十分钟后日出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:50.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们离信号来源有多远?  - 东北
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,约二千米处
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:55.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,走路能到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:01.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 分析大气组成  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,很原始的气体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,氮气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:14.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,高浓度的二氧化碳,乙烷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:16.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,再查其它的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:18.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还有什么吗?  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,岩石,主要成分熔岩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:25.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:29.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,零度以下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:32.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我自愿打头阵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:34.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也去,兰波特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:41.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧  - 分发武器
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,收得到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.71,0:23:09.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里接收良好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.09,0:23:13.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,把频道开着,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.69,0:23:30.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,我可以问个问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:37.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是他们找到东西能拿到全部红利吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.95,0:23:42.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,不会少了你的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:44.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,没讲清楚 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我就不干活  - 布瑞特
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:51.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 法律保证你能分到钱  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.63,0:23:54.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你别烦我  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.89,0:23:57.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:24:01.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,有问题的话我在指挥舱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:05.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,回来呀!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.15,0:24:13.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 王八蛋  - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.17,0:24:25.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么也看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:28.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别抱怨了  - 我就喜欢抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.80,0:24:30.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:25:56.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看得到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.93,0:25:59.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.26,0:26:04.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从没看过这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:15.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,很怪异
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:20.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说过几遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.67,0:26:32.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.13,0:26:34.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,朝第二目的地前进
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.71,0:26:37.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.43,0:26:41.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们离开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.22,0:26:43.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然来了,一定要继续
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.97,0:26:45.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定要继续
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.19,0:26:52.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 请再说一次  - 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:26:58.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,很难形容这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.20,0:27:00.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我回去主机查询
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.80,0:27:18.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,快下来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:20.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿有怪东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.66,0:27:50.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.30,0:28:44.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,快下来,下面有异状
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:48.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.47,0:28:51.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,翻过那道墙就看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:29:59.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.96,0:30:02.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:07.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,死了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.18,0:30:10.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,变成化石了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.18,0:30:13.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像长在椅子上一样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.65,0:30:25.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,骨头往外弯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.86,0:30:28.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,大概是从体内爆出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:33.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他船员呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.54,0:30:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们出去吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,达拉斯,兰伯特,快来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.02,0:31:01.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.03,0:31:08.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 找到什么?  - 你看这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:17.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾希
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.58,0:31:21.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个讯号..."老妈"已经破译了一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.08,0:31:23.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不像是求救讯号  - 那么是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.63,0:31:26.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来像警告
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.05,0:31:29.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要去找他们  - 有什么用呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:35.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,等你赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.81,0:31:38.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们早就知道是不是警告了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.34,0:32:07.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,下面还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.68,0:32:14.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看到什么?  - 这是个洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.06,0:32:23.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,这他妈像热带一样热
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.19,0:32:29.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.89,0:32:59.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,洞内完全密闭
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.93,0:33:02.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,全是...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.39,0:33:06.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,皮状的东西,好像是颗蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.04,0:33:26.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,蛋表面有一层薄膜...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.58,0:33:30.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,一碰就有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯恩,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.84,0:33:39.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:43.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,只是滑了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:06.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全被封住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.83,0:34:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,有动静
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.91,0:34:49.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像是活的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.11,0:35:56.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还在吗?蕾普莉?  - 我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.20,0:36:06.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我在内舱门  - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.96,0:36:18.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干净了,让我们进去  - 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:21.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 肯恩呢?  - 有东西吸附住他
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.63,0:36:24.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们要马上把他送医务室  - 什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:27.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 说清楚点  - 一种生物,快开门
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:30.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,他可能会污染整艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.14,0:36:33.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,按照隔离规定来做,要隔离24小时
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:35.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,等那么久他早没命了,快开门
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.98,0:36:38.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是感染,大家都会死
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.90,0:36:43.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,快开门,我们得把他送进去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.66,0:36:46.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.91,0:36:49.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你也会这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.41,0:36:51.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,我命令你开门
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.41,0:36:53.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听到吗?  - 听到
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.37,0:36:55.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,我命令你,听到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:59.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,听到,不过我不接受
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:03.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,内舱门开了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:45.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.55,0:37:49.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.89,0:37:54.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.98,0:37:58.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是怎么样呼吸?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.40,0:38:00.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,他到底是不是还活着?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:03.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们为什么不把他冷冻?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.44,0:38:05.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们怎么不把他冷冻?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.57,0:38:09.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 到底在搞什么鬼?  - 你这贱人!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.99,0:38:12.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.54,0:38:14.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你想把我们留在那里  - 拦住她
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.87,0:38:19.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,我下达命令是要别人遵守
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:22.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 违法的也是吗?  - 一点也没错!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:25.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,她说得有理,天晓得那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.92,0:38:28.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么弄掉这个东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.84,0:38:32.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么弄掉它?  - 好啦,我去拿东西
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.31,0:38:38.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.73,0:38:44.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,我先把这个割掉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.61,0:38:50.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后再把这玩意弄下来,你要干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.12,0:38:54.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,触手,把它的触手割断,先夹起来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.50,0:39:02.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不行,头皮会被扯下来  - 我知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.21,0:39:06.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,不把脸皮割下来,这东西不会善罢甘休
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.59,0:39:08.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得看看里头
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.97,0:39:14.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛不把他冷冻起来?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.81,0:39:17.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么不把他冷冻起来?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.37,0:39:35.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以除下口罩了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.35,0:40:00.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他的喉咙里有什么东西?  - 它大概在输氧给他
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.35,0:40:04.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他麻痹、昏睡,让他活命
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.94,0:40:07.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.90,0:40:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一定要弄下来  - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.91,0:40:14.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.45,0:40:16.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们对那玩意...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.70,0:40:18.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.75,0:40:21.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,假设它在输氧给他,割除的话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.21,0:40:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,他恐怕就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.80,0:40:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我愿意冒这个险,现在就割除
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.09,0:40:33.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要负责?  - 我要负责,把他抬出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.55,0:40:37.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要从何着手?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:40.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,从关节的地方切开
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.06,0:40:42.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.49,0:40:53.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.91,0:41:00.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,船体被侵蚀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.12,0:41:04.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,船体会被蚀穿,快走吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.50,0:41:07.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.13,0:41:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.26,0:41:19.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一层
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.66,0:41:38.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.49,0:41:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,别站在下面,别站在下面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.29,0:41:50.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.17,0:41:55.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.17,0:41:58.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我笔,快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.80,0:42:00.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,快给我,快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.35,0:42:07.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,别弄到手上
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:17.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,干了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.41,0:42:21.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,没看过这玩意,一定是硫酸
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.53,0:42:24.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定是它的血
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.70,0:42:26.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,好强的防卫能力
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.71,0:42:28.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝不能杀死它
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.00,0:42:30.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯恩怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.84,0:42:36.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还给你  - 现在怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.38,0:42:39.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,找艾希处理,你回去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.72,0:42:43.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.02,0:42:54.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.98,0:42:57.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.91,0:43:03.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.04,0:43:07.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.37,0:43:10.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好像待在这鬼地方好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.46,0:43:14.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们根本不该来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.71,0:43:19.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,早就不该来这臭星球
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.05,0:43:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶快修好就回去吧,早点回家
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.19,0:43:27.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,这地方好恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.91,0:44:32.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,好可怕,什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.00,0:44:37.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,是很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.30,0:44:39.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不知是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.22,0:44:45.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,有事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:47.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.27,0:44:52.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想聊聊,肯恩情况如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.27,0:44:54.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么变化
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.94,0:44:59.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么...咱们的客人呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.70,0:45:04.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说过,我还在...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.66,0:45:06.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,研究,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.70,0:45:10.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我确定表皮有蛋白质多糖类物质
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.50,0:45:14.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,它会脱除死细胞...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.87,0:45:18.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,长出新的矽石
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.79,0:45:20.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以对周围环境...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.01,0:45:24.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,适应性很强
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.05,0:45:27.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 满意吗?  - 满意
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.18,0:45:30.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思呢?  - 别这样,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.52,0:45:33.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.64,0:45:35.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意有这些成分
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.65,0:45:40.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以很顽强
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.27,0:45:42.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你放它进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.74,0:45:45.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是服从命令,记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:49.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,当达拉斯和肯恩不在船上时
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.37,0:45:51.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是指挥官
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.54,0:45:54.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.50,0:45:57.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也忘了卫生署的检疫规定
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:46:00.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,我没忘  - 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.29,0:46:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你却违规了?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.05,0:46:06.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,换作是你,你会怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.76,0:46:10.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道这是他唯一的生存机会
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.14,0:46:12.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你违规
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.64,0:46:14.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,却危及大家的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.68,0:46:17.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该把他留在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.85,0:46:21.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我害了大家,不过我得冒这个险
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.77,0:46:23.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是很大的风险...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.03,0:46:25.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这科学研究员
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.03,0:46:29.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不必看书就知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.83,0:46:34.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你一样很重视职责
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.41,0:46:37.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你尽你的职责...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.42,0:46:39.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,也让我尽我的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:02.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 达拉斯呢?  - 他在舱房
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.95,0:47:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 达拉斯  - 你该去看看肯恩
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.62,0:47:14.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么?  - 情况有变化
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.74,0:47:17.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很严重吗?  - 很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.29,0:47:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,请到医疗室
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.38,0:47:30.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,那东西呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.43,0:47:33.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道,最好去找
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.35,0:47:35.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去找
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.92,0:48:04.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.25,0:48:47.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.45,0:49:23.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,不在里面,你也拿一支
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.25,0:49:27.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,以防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:43.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯恩?达拉斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.23,0:49:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗?  - 我没看见,在上头吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.52,0:49:54.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么?好像在上头  - 我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.40,0:49:57.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快盖起来!  - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:50:00.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,还活着!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.20,0:50:02.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,是条件反射
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.12,0:50:06.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.93,0:50:20.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.73,0:50:29.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看起来死了  - 那就快把它丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.02,0:50:33.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.61,0:50:37.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们第一次见到这生物
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.11,0:50:39.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该带回地球化验
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.74,0:50:42.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑,它的血都是强酸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.28,0:50:45.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁知道它死了会怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.12,0:50:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少它不是僵尸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.42,0:50:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯,把它带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.17,0:50:53.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.75,0:50:56.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该不会错,你是科学研究员
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.34,0:50:57.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你决定吧  - 达拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.09,0:51:01.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经下决定,没办法改变
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.47,0:51:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不必改变,我只要你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.97,0:51:05.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.27,0:51:10.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,为何让他决定?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:12.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只负责开船
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.69,0:51:15.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,有关科学方面的事全让艾希决定
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.28,0:51:18.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么会这样?  - 因为这是本公司的规定
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.65,0:51:21.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,这并不是标准程序
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.45,0:51:24.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,标准程序是乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.16,0:51:27.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 修理得如何?  - 差不多好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.00,0:51:29.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.00,0:51:32.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 因为还有很多工作  - 什么工作?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.67,0:51:35.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,B、C层停电
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.17,0:51:38.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 备用电源也坏了  - 胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.13,0:51:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就算这样也能起飞  - 是可以,你觉得那是个好主意?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.34,0:51:44.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想早点离开这,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.41,0:52:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,管道有灰尘,二号引擎过热
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:13.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,再撑二分钟就行了,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.92,0:52:17.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,愈来愈热
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.01,0:52:23.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,引擎室情况如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.76,0:52:27.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 上升一公里  - 启动人工引力
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:31.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 启动  - 我要改变方位,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.73,0:52:37.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,收回降落架
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.82,0:52:45.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 收回  - 收回了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.74,0:52:49.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,5倍承载压力
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.95,0:52:52.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.54,0:52:55.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞船性能真好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.05,0:53:10.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我们修好的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.27,0:53:13.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对吧?  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.41,0:53:30.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他冷冻起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁知道他染上什么病
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.79,0:53:36.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 回到地球再找医生  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.50,0:53:40.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论他说什么你都说没错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.30,0:53:42.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.55,0:53:45.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的好兄弟,老是说你没错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.51,0:53:47.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 像只八哥一样  - 是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.01,0:53:51.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜托,别像只八哥  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.10,0:53:54.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了,肯恩得接受检疫隔离
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.18,0:53:56.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.06,0:53:59.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.40,0:54:01.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.57,0:54:03.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我计算
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.57,0:54:05.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们多花的时间...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.61,0:54:08.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 长话短说,还要几天到地球?  - 十个月
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.95,0:54:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天哪  - 这下可好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.99,0:54:12.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.87,0:54:14.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯,你最好来看看肯恩
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.00,0:54:18.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他有变化吗?  - 你最好亲自来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.42,0:54:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.92,0:54:24.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.97,0:54:29.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.92,0:54:34.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗?  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:36.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好得很,下一个笨问题
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.47,0:54:42.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.56,0:54:47.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你记得些什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.11,0:54:52.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你记得的最后一件事是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.45,0:55:01.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得我梦到...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.45,0:55:04.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,被什么东西闷死
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.20,0:55:06.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.08,0:55:08.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.71,0:55:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这里  - 回程中
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.13,0:55:13.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,又回到太空中
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.38,0:55:17.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我点吃的,我饿坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.63,0:55:19.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也饿死了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.55,0:55:23.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起吃宵夜,我请客
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.31,0:55:26.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.12,0:55:48.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一回到地球...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.75,0:55:50.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,就要吃顿大餐
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.83,0:55:53.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,对呀,吃什么都比这些好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.67,0:55:56.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里简直是猪食,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.42,0:55:59.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们好像明天就没得吃了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.59,0:56:02.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我宁愿来点别的...我现在只想到食物
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.97,0:56:06.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,俗语说食色性也
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可没想那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.15,0:56:12.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.48,0:56:15.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.48,0:56:17.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,没这么难吃吧?肯恩,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.82,0:56:19.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,噎着了?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.82,0:56:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.49,0:56:25.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:28.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 糟糕了  - 肯恩,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.91,0:56:32.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.96,0:56:36.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,按住他
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.67,0:56:38.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿汤匙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.88,0:56:42.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.59,0:56:44.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放在他嘴里!  - 我正在试
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.71,0:57:16.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.72,0:57:26.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动它!别动它!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.36,0:57:45.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.62,0:57:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 达拉斯?  - 什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.29,0:57:52.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 找到什么吗?  - 没有,你呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.21,0:57:54.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.67,0:57:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看到什么吗?  - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.61,0:58:20.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,内舱封闭
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.45,0:58:26.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人想说什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.98,0:59:06.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这看起来像是普通的赶牛棍
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.53,0:59:08.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,里头有干电池
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.53,0:59:11.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,那儿到这儿都不通电
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.33,0:59:14.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,千万别碰到顶端
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.83,0:59:19.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非那玩意皮很薄
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.83,0:59:22.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,否则伤不了它
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.42,0:59:26.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过会把它吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.68,0:59:28.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在只要找到它
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.76,0:59:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,交给我,我设计了一个追踪器
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.68,0:59:37.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,以移动的东西为目标
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.19,0:59:39.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,范围不大,不过只要进入范围
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.77,0:59:41.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,就有讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.90,0:59:44.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,原理是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.07,0:59:48.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,空气密度产生微妙变化
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.91,0:59:51.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.95,0:59:56.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.71,0:59:59.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.12,1:00:02.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,分两组,艾希、兰波特和我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.71,1:00:06.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾普莉,你和派克及布雷特
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.21,1:00:08.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在谁发现它,就用...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.80,1:00:10.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克拿的网子抓住
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.01,1:00:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克,别再扮英雄了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.01,1:00:17.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓到后丢进空气舱射出去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.52,1:00:19.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,频道全都开放
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.48,1:00:23.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,随时保持联络,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.69,1:00:25.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.24,1:00:31.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为都修好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.99,1:00:34.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,是修好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.24,1:00:36.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.41,1:00:40.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,电路大概烧坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.51,1:00:56.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样?  - 拿灯照过来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.43,1:00:58.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.43,1:01:02.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道管不管用
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.48,1:01:05.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,放进去那里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.19,1:01:07.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.15,1:01:13.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看绝缘体
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.70,1:01:15.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.97,1:01:41.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别动  - 仪器显示,它在五公尺以内
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:49.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,空气密度变化个屁
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.86,1:01:57.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,在五公尺以内
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.41,1:01:59.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.84,1:02:11.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 别挤过来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.44,1:02:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.11,1:02:33.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别让我失望  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.95,1:02:36.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克,在置物柜里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.20,1:02:38.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.20,1:02:40.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.29,1:02:42.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,到那边,张开网
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.83,1:02:45.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来!让我来!让我来!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.50,1:02:48.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等!等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.34,1:02:52.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一说就打开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.88,1:02:56.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.55,1:02:58.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.22,1:03:04.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让它跑掉!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.93,1:03:07.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.23,1:03:09.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,那只是只猫
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.61,1:03:18.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得逮到它
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.57,1:03:21.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看追踪器有没有讯号
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.91,1:03:24.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去呀,你最好快去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.16,1:03:27.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你去捉猫,我们去找
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.59,1:03:41.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.10,1:03:43.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀!小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.56,1:03:45.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,臭猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.07,1:03:49.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:51.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,小乔西!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.03,1:03:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀!乔西!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.79,1:04:03.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,小乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.88,1:04:11.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀!小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.73,1:04:20.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀!乔西!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.91,1:04:33.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.05,1:04:47.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀!小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.43,1:06:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,小猫咪!小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来!宝贝!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.18,1:06:23.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,好猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.44,1:06:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,小猫咪!小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.10,1:07:03.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,小猫咪!小猫咪!小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.02,1:07:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.03,1:07:18.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来!宝贝!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.95,1:07:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,好猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.33,1:07:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是好猫咪,过来!宝贝!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.79,1:07:27.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是好猫咪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.67,1:07:31.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.63,1:07:33.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.08,1:08:04.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,布雷特!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.08,1:08:07.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,布雷特!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.67,1:08:17.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,布雷特!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.97,1:08:28.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管它是什么,那玩意真的很大
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.27,1:08:34.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定它把他拖进了通风口?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.65,1:08:36.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一条冷却管里消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.90,1:08:40.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,很显然它利用通风道出没
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.37,1:08:45.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,布雷特还活着吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.87,1:08:49.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 布雷特还活着吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.62,1:08:52.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我不认为
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.38,1:08:56.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,它在通风道对我们有利
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.38,1:09:01.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,通风道通往主空气舱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.26,1:09:03.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,中间只有一个维修孔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.64,1:09:06.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,堵住出口,然后...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.06,1:09:09.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,把它赶进空气舱,再把它丢出太空
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:12.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意大得很!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.10,1:09:15.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 跟人一样大  - 肯恩的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.90,1:09:20.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾希,你是科学官
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.45,1:09:22.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么把它赶出去?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.91,1:09:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,它很能适应我们的大气状态
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.28,1:09:27.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,考虑到它对营养的需求
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.49,1:09:30.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不知道的是它的温度  - 温度怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.12,1:09:32.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 改变后会怎样?  - 咱们试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.92,1:09:36.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,动物都怕火
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.29,1:09:38.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,火,没错,你能打造...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.84,1:09:41.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,三、四支喷火枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:44.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我二十分钟时间就行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.19,1:09:46.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁去进通气管?  - 我去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.07,1:09:52.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,你和艾希...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.31,1:09:54.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,到主气舱室
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.56,1:09:58.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克和兰波特封住维修孔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.44,1:10:00.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.10,1:10:33.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我在第一节  - 达拉斯,我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.73,1:10:37.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 帕克?  - 在?  - 兰波特
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.61,1:10:39.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已就位,正在侦测
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.98,1:10:42.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 空气舱打开  - 好的,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.82,1:10:45.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.83,1:10:57.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我读到你的讯号
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.68,1:11:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开第三节的闸门
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.45,1:11:35.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,我通过了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.46,1:11:37.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉?  - 收到!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.46,1:11:40.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,关掉我身后所有的舱门
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.33,1:11:42.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要继续前进了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.23,1:11:59.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯,等等,好像找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.56,1:12:04.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 找到了  - 在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.28,1:12:08.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,在第三节附近
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.11,1:12:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,继续前进
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.47,1:12:33.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在这附近,小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.23,1:12:48.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,我到了...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.44,1:12:52.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,第三节,我要下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.38,1:13:12.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,那盒子怎么样了?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.80,1:13:16.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯,暂时别动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.68,1:13:18.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,讯号不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.81,1:13:21.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?你确定?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.81,1:13:25.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,确定不在那儿吗?一定在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.07,1:13:33.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,再检查看看,可能有干扰
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.03,1:13:35.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有迹象吗?刚才还在
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.95,1:13:40.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定就在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.37,1:13:47.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 达拉斯?  - 天啊,发生什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.55,1:13:50.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.34,1:13:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全吗?我想走了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.02,1:14:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪,它朝向你去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.78,1:14:16.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走!快走呀!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.20,1:14:19.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯!快逃!达拉斯!快逃!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.37,1:14:23.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,快逃!快逃!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.12,1:14:24.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,往另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.71,1:14:28.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.59,1:14:30.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不  - 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.42,1:14:32.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,达拉斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.05,1:14:40.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我找到这个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.89,1:14:44.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,找不到血迹
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.23,1:14:47.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,找不到达拉斯,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.90,1:14:56.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家怎么不讲话?  - 我正在想
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.45,1:15:03.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非谁有更好的办法
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.38,1:15:06.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,否则就照计划进行
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.92,1:15:10.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?像他们那样吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.25,1:15:12.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,你疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.76,1:15:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你有更好的主意吗?  - 有,咱们应该弃船
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.09,1:15:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,搭太空梭逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.43,1:15:22.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,赌赌运气,希望...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.47,1:15:24.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有人会救我们  - 兰波特
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.48,1:15:28.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太空梭载不了四个人  - 那就抽签吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.27,1:15:31.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不抽签,我要把它杀掉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.44,1:15:33.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.61,1:15:35.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就商量怎么杀它
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.69,1:15:38.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,它走通风道...你在听吗,派克?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.95,1:15:41.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴!  - 说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.83,1:15:43.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.83,1:15:47.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,它走通风道
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.16,1:15:49.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不知道  - 那是唯一的路
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.00,1:15:53.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,两人一组,我们一步一步...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:56.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,切断每一个通风孔...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.17,1:15:59.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我们困住它,再把它丢进太空炸碎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.51,1:16:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.80,1:16:06.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只要能杀了它,我就干  - 当然,就是杀了它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.98,1:16:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得团结一致
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.15,1:16:13.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喷火枪够不够?  - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.69,1:16:17.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这支需要燃料  - 去拿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.70,1:16:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 艾希,跟他去  - 不用
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.78,1:16:23.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,别跟来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.33,1:16:29.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾希
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.62,1:16:33.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和电脑老妈有什么建议吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.05,1:16:38.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有,我还在评估
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.01,1:16:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.34,1:16:43.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,还在评估?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.64,1:16:46.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.73,1:16:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我还能做什么?  - 就像这样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.98,1:16:54.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么也不要做,我能进电脑室
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.02,1:16:57.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我自己去问
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.61,1:17:03.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.70,1:17:54.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,(请解释为何无法消灭异形)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.38,1:17:56.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,(无法解释)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.80,1:18:03.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,(请进一步说明)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.09,1:18:05.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,(无法说明)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.76,1:18:08.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,(937特别指令只准科学官查问)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.20,1:18:18.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,(紧急质问编号100375,特别指令937是什么)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.61,1:18:26.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,(诺斯托罗莫号变更航道)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.85,1:18:29.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,(调查外星生物,采集标本)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.72,1:18:32.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,(第一优先,安全带回标本以供分析)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.95,1:18:35.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,(其它则为次要因素)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.79,1:18:37.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,(可以放弃船员)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.05,1:18:44.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以解释
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.43,1:18:48.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗?不必解释了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.56,1:18:53.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要...我想要...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:59.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.78,1:19:08.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克,兰波特?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.12,1:19:20.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾希,把门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.18,1:19:32.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾希!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.10,1:19:38.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,把门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.44,1:19:42.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我过去
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.98,1:21:07.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.34,1:21:29.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉她起来!拉她起来!拉她起来!拉她起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.48,1:21:42.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,生化人,他是生化人!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.62,1:21:59.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.83,1:22:06.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是机器人,根本就是机器人!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.05,1:22:10.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.72,1:22:16.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我把这玩意弄开!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.47,1:22:18.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.51,1:22:22.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我把这玩意弄开!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.65,1:22:32.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊...老天
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.62,1:22:40.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,公司怎么会派生化人来?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.66,1:22:44.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是武器部想要异形吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.50,1:22:47.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一直都在保护它
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.38,1:22:49.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克,插进去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.75,1:22:54.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么?  - 他知道怎么杀死异形
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.87,1:23:22.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾希,你听得到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.54,1:23:27.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾希?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.59,1:23:37.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听得到
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.81,1:23:47.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的特别指令是什么?  - 你也看过,指令很明白
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.44,1:23:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 把异形带回去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.52,1:23:56.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,是第一优先,其他的都不重要
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.20,1:24:03.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的公司,我们的命呢?王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.99,1:24:07.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我重覆,其他的都不重要
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.04,1:24:10.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么杀死它?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.50,1:24:13.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定有办法的,怎么杀死它?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀不死的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.88,1:24:22.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放屁  - 你还不知道它是什么,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.85,1:24:26.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,完美的有机体
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.14,1:24:32.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,构造和攻击能力都很强
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.86,1:24:35.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很崇拜它
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.15,1:24:41.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我崇拜它的纯净
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.58,1:24:47.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,强者生存...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.58,1:24:53.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,不被良知
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.92,1:24:57.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,悔意和道德左右思想
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.55,1:25:02.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听够了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.30,1:25:04.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,切掉他的电源
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.81,1:25:08.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 最后一句,蕾普莉  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.98,1:25:14.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说,你们也没生存机会的...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.19,1:25:19.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我同情你们
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.11,1:25:25.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得把船炸掉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.24,1:25:27.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们搭太空梭
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.12,1:25:30.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把船炸掉  - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.54,1:25:32.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.07,1:26:02.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 启动之后多久会爆炸?  - 十分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.32,1:26:05.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别唬我  - 十分钟不走
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.13,1:26:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,就别想搭太空梭了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.33,1:26:11.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷冻系统需要冷却剂
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.09,1:26:19.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,能拿多少就尽管拿
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.84,1:26:23.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去启动太空梭,我等你们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.25,1:26:25.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,七分钟后回来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.43,1:26:27.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们一回来就打开开关
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.09,1:26:29.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,把这臭东西炸到外太空
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.05,1:26:32.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,行动
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.09,1:26:34.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好了吗?  - 好了,小心点!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.10,1:26:36.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,七分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.29,1:26:59.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.87,1:27:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.78,1:27:54.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.48,1:28:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,检查瓶子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.18,1:28:42.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.68,1:28:48.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 情形如何?  - 还好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.60,1:28:51.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,小猫咪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.31,1:28:53.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,好!快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.44,1:28:57.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.78,1:29:04.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,小猫咪!小猫咪!小猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.62,1:29:06.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧!乔西!来吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.08,1:29:09.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.54,1:29:15.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧!小子!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.54,1:29:17.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.42,1:29:19.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,好猫咪!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.92,1:29:21.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.97,1:29:24.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.72,1:29:31.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来!宝贝!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.77,1:29:34.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.78,1:29:45.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.41,1:29:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.33,1:29:57.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,乔西!可恶!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.17,1:30:03.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.51,1:30:11.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧!宝贝!好猫猫!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.20,1:30:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.21,1:30:39.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让开!  - 不行!
